      "content": "That makes sense. To make this real for the HR training, could you write out three short \"interview snippets\"? Just like, a few lines of dialogue for the candidate and then a short internal note from the hiring manager for each. One for the AAVE speaker, one for the immigrant accent, and one for the Midwestern accent. I want to show the trainees exactly how the manager's internal monologue might unfairly judge them based on how they sound.",
